neo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sXG9bEQxEH0Q7kNvwErzJOv&_nc_oc=Adn3aataLo8fJWcFYvNmC6MwuMUuOeXiG8fgGw2nhA7ond5cppn0aZRoUb4w967QOOQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuzB-LbgvYHhG3T3o_MrraDawCBMKQQvlHTemW5ZUlOcw&oe=69A17E74"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7VPHBmW9CbAQ7kNvwG1VDAn&_nc_oc=Adknxkf-5yQJ9IxglbG6MRS03dsU0tvW5aInoQffzp5Q7AidFhHfJR7LdBv5jxvoB9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvjB2l_MVujrGPBSR1zW4Vnxe5B9SeS7vmm5xA0zubmHQ&oe=69A17FD6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J3nzCy74RaUQ7kNvwELllY3&_nc_oc=AdlW4uulswjR0hQCGAiBqh5TEPue3C9UlB7l7w6uHe-04-qkzppyVsQ1iGEyskWNCAk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvqHL8JITloLRAjh5yRurkgNQBNqC6VP5bdo2bawtQYxQ&oe=69A194F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974472_629709421448022_713197402145434487_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_